{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"78aea549-11d3-46b2-b6e1-ad4593cf0e03","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The session replay was empty because the new UI’s root widget (`MaterialApp.router` in **`lib/new_app.dart`**) was not wrapped in **`PostHogWidget`**. Without this wrapper the SDK records events but cannot capture visual frames, so no replay appears.\n\n**Fix applied**  \nThe `MaterialApp.router` has been wrapped with `PostHogWidget` (see the diff applied to `lib/new_app.dart`). A comment can be added to remind future developers to keep the wrapper around any root app widget.\n\n**Verification steps**\n\n1. Run the app on a device/emulator.  \n2. Navigate through a few screens and then background the app to let the SDK flush.  \n3. In PostHog → Session Replay, you should now see a new session entry for the new UI, and playback will show the actual UI flow.\n\n**Full explanation \u0026 documentation** – see the generated answer file:\n\n[ANSWER.md](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhava/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/78aea549-11d3-46b2-b6e1-ad4593cf0e03/ANSWER.md)\n","duration_seconds":28.891406,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":20990,"output_tokens":2677,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":97728,"total_tokens":23667}}}
